WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Sou ekran dakèy radyo a, tape Settings.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Tape Wi-Fi. Tann rezo ou parèt.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Chwazi rezo ou. Scan rafrechi lis la; Type name pèmèt ou antre non an.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Antre modpas Wi-Fi a sou radyo a, epi tape Connect.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Tann ekran dakèy la. Si koneksyon an pa mache, verifye modpas la epi eseye ankò.
